      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I haven't confirmed whether this ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/vrcsdk330-incorrectly-determined-fallback-avatar-button ) bug occurs in the latest version, but I think setting a\n\nfallback without upload is also effective for this as a workaround. (If SDK won't be fixed.)",
